text = "A moonlit threshold station of brass fittings, midnight-blue glass, and slow drifting steam. Five rooms loop around a central platform beneath a great skylight that frames the crossing moon. The 12-minute moon meter ticks softly overhead, and lantern bloom catches every polished gear."
